 Notes
 • Tests TC-60 to TC-92 create bookings, payments and returns through the procedures; TC-93 and TC-94 delete
 them again, so the suite can be run repeatedly.
 • Overdue and "current rental" tests depend on CURDATE(). The sample data uses date offsets, so they pass on
 any day.
 • While writing these tests TC-70 caught a real bug: an invalid payment_mode (a warning-class error in strict
 mode) was not rolled back by sp_book_vehicle. The procedures' handlers now cover SQLWARNING as well as
 SQLEXCEPTION.